  "notes": "{好況|こうきょう} refers to economic prosperity or a boom period—when business is thriving.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {好況|こうきょう}に{沸|わ}く: to be in the midst of a boom\n- {空前|くうぜん}の{好況|こうきょう}: unprecedented prosperity\n- {好況|こうきょう}が{続|つづ}く: prosperity continues\n- {好況|こうきょう}{時|じ}: during good economic times\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {好況|こうきょう}: prosperity, boom\n- {不況|ふきょう}: recession, depression\n- {景気|けいき}: economic conditions (general term)\n\nKANJI:\n{好|こう} (good) + {況|きょう} (condition) = good economic condition.",
